{"resourceIdentifier":"4496","resourceName":"Jiangxi Xinsheng Swine Farm Manure Management System GHG Mitigation Project","description":"Jiangxi Xinsheng Swine Farm Manure Management System GHG Mitigation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) introduce animal waste management system (AWMS) to the two swine farms in Jinggangshan City and Anfu County, Ji’an City, Jiangxi Province, China, which are owned by Jinggangshan Xinsheng Agricultural Products Development Co., Ltd. The project activity aims to treat the manure and wastewater from the 2 swine farms to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons.\r\nAll the manure and wastewater are collected and then be separated first. The solid will be treated in aerobic composting system and the organic fertilizers will be produced, part of the fertilizer produced in this process will be distributed to local farmers for free and the others will be sold in domestic market. The liquid will be treated through anaerobic digestion and the biogas generated during the treatment process will be captured and sent to boilers for heat generation and Surplus biogas will be destroyed through the flaring system (if any). The sludge produced from anaerobic digestion will be treated through aerobic composting together with the solid, the effluent will be supplied to the farmers living around free for agriculture irrigation.","location":{"latitude":26.765200,"longitude":114.083300},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-23","endExclusive":"2023-09-23","endInclusive":"2023-09-22"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4496"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangxi Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jinggangshan Xinsheng Agricultural Products Development Co.,Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Jiangxi Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 18970457888"},{"type":"string","value":"33950732@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"30750"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"02/12/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/02/2022 - 31/01/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=91667&IDKEY=j097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87u126408793","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"Jiangxi Xinsheng Swine Farm Manure Management System GHG Mitigation Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-06-15T06:42:34.623Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=91666&IDKEY=nlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku0982126407414","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Xinsheng_Listing_Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-06-15T06:36:42.62Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=123836&IDKEY=uq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfha170769844","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS4496_PD_Nov 2024.PDF","uploadDate":"2024-12-02T19:05:20.413Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=106698&IDKEY=slksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098h147136542","documentT